<title>USA: U.S. debt futures close higher, T-bonds off peaks.</title>
<headline>U.S. debt futures close higher, T-bonds off peaks.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 12 - U.S. debt futures closed higher, but T-bonds ended off session peaks due to profit-taking. June T-bonds inched up to 110-16/32, above the 2-1/2-mos high, earlier in the day.</p>
<p>Traders said pit activity was light ahead of heavy schedule of U.S. economic reports this week.</p>
